# YouTube Trending Data Analysis

## Project Overview
Cleaned and visualized YouTube trending data using Python (Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib).

## Tools
- Python
- Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib
- Jupyter Notebook / Google Colab

## Key Findings
- Best publish time: *2–5 PM*
- Category with most views: *Entertainment*
- Likes ratio > 0.95 is common for trending videos

## Files in this repo
- youtube_analysis.ipynb – complete code with cleaning and charts
- cleaned_youtube_data.csv – cleaned dataset (if included)
- images/ – charts from the analysis (if you uploaded them)

## How to run
1. Download the .ipynb file.
2. Upload to [Google Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/).
3. Run all cells.

